{"title":"1992 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8d708f208be3141edf6a0c74b96ec07518a608.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y}{x-z}=\\frac{x+y}{z}=\\frac{x}{y}\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"39\" />\nfor three positive numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b6400c6fe3f1ed70e5afd387a9686cdc3fa09531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, all different, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/b/2fb382f8afe32a272b7dab383b23b9ba9bf79ca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"33\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/c/87cef2edd86dfe289ebe2d10df45318a96019f25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\frac{1}{2}\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{3}{5}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{2}{3}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\frac{5}{3}\\quad \\text{(E) } 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"279\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" /> We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/e/f3e06c818cd6b99d8d17d8dbe8c78ee1e9371905.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x+y}{z} = \\frac{x}{y} \\implies xy+y^2=xz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"236\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/2/4924d12af7b1148da646b413de0e79419f4e7ce2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{x-z} = \\frac{x}{y} \\implies y^2=x^2-xz \\implies x^2-y^2=xz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"384\" height=\"36\" />. Equating the two expressions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dd70347c7940f63ff9417e383548564fd92aff7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/3/d9373cd1676396cc37f08779fb4f7a64e5987ea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy+y^2=x^2-y^2 \\implies x^2-xy-2y^2=0 \\implies (x+y)(x-2y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"535\" height=\"19\" />, so as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3da9f8c7fe0473fdd6f8597eff61d71fedda430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for positive <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/8/508381722117a922cfb40df947aa6f444489b8eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-2y=0 \\implies x=2y \\implies \\frac{x}{y}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"284\" height=\"36\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We cross multiply the first and third fractions and the second and third fractions, respectively, for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/b/5eb16823e18d76db5247d40b70e28a217036b11e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(x-z)=y^2\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/5/2c523f62ab69de16ec6a67cdca61ec748a53fc66.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y(x+y)=xz\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" /> Notice how the first equation can be expanded and rearranged to contain an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/6/3b6721de26243607a9c1746d59a1289b2a925245.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> term. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e341b30843ce195c4d11901a1f80685772b842.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-xz=y^2\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f0b53cb93c903ac3f676d52f5cbe7e7adaa22eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2-y^2=xz\\]\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/8/128ab98ec4d2662f7b7ddfa4717de3f91c123198.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y)(x-y)=xz\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" /> We can divide this by the second equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/1/911f1111eeea9b3caaff6f06285d450f30162e67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{(x+y)(x-y)}{y(x+y)}=\\frac{xz}{xz}\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"43\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0aba277433796620abeb01879ffdcb8cb05c3cc8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x-y}{y}=1\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"36\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a0ce68998a8c4c1aafe8351ae0a65e1d036ac05.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{y}-1=1\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"36\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/425ce52604311b453a6acfdedd7e2012b2cb9dba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x}{y}=2 \\rightarrow \\boxed{E}\\]\" width=\"100\" height=\"36\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/0/300cf6e884eefd9f565617a03d8bd4a405a298f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a_1}{b_1} = \\frac{a_2}{b_2} = ... = \\frac{a_n}{b_n} = \\frac{a_1 + a_2+ ... + a_n}{b_1 + b_2 + ... + b_n},\\]\" width=\"317\" height=\"38\" /> we can say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/3/523a6d18ba88680cbab4181df323d2ac31c9da9f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y}{x-z} = \\frac{x+y}{z} = \\frac{x}{y} = \\frac {y+(x+y)+x}{(x-z)+z+y} = \\boxed{2}.\\]\" width=\"350\" height=\"43\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/5/9e537e755ddb96fefa34828e9ad61a0c0d2afd7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies \\boxed{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/9/ae9d6519138e93af1322119ee54070be505d893e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{Proof of the used property:}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"231\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df8d666f9ca607f7a433e35b9492ed9734ed6b52.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a_1}{b_1} = \\frac{a_2}{b_2} = \\frac{a_3}{b_3} = ... = \\frac{a_n}{b_n} = r.\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/291c55867975a25bda08ce89074043c6e29f36a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a_1 &amp;= b_1r,\\\\ a_2 &amp;= b_2r,\\\\ ...,\\\\ a_n &amp;= b_nr \\end{align*}\" width=\"70\" height=\"90\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/7/1d7c4b217c7d55d219c4944face9b82f580ca767.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a_1 + a_2+ ... + a_n}{b_1 + b_2 + ... + b_n} = \\frac{b_1r + b_2r + ... + b_nr}{b_1 + b_2 + ... + b_n}\\]\" width=\"318\" height=\"40\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b6f89866f0d3eb5422a201b9da2ca8313f7bdf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= \\frac{(b_1 + b_2 + ... + b_n)(nr)}{(b_1 + b_2 + ... + b_n)(n)} = r\\]\" width=\"231\" height=\"43\" /> --- NamelyOrange\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_.28English-Chinese_Bilingual.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MRENTHUSIASM_(English-Chinese_Bilingual)\">Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MRENTHUSIASM (English-Chinese Bilingual)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/mQhgziRQlW4\">https://youtu.be/mQhgziRQlW4</a>\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME\" title=\"1992 AHSME\">1992 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1992 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1992_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1992 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" hr